{"content_hash": "aa304f1bea07c556", "version_id": 944, "article_id": 95, "level_code": "en_b2", "lang": "en", "level": 4, "level_label": "B2 中高级", "title": "Call of Duty: Modern Warfare 4 tops Steam weekly sales chart", "title_zh": "《使命召唤：现代战争4》登顶Steam周销量榜", "has_translation": true, "topic": "culture", "source": "gcores", "source_url": "https://www.gcores.com/articles/222184", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1672545701317-5177e9f41166?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8MTB8fHN0ZWFtfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTQ0NTAxODh8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Paul Crook on Unsplash", "author": "Paul Crook", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@goldenplover31?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-black-train-traveling-down-train-tracks-next-to-a-lush-green-field-HIPH-vbN8Kg?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(264, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(302, 46%, 48%)", "label": "CULTURE", "seed": "2e082aa759d3"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-12", "word_count": 190, "reading_minutes": 0.9, "lead": "Valve has published its latest global Steam bestseller list for the first week of November 2026. As usual, free-to-play games were left out, so the ranking offers a clearer picture of what players are actually buying.", "lead_zh": "Valve公布了2026年11月第一周的Steam全球销量排行榜。和往常一样，榜单没有把免费游戏算进去，因此更能看出玩家真正在买什么。", "preview": "Call of Duty: Modern Warfare 4 took first place this week, giving the long-running shooter series another strong launch. Phantom Blade Zero,", "preview_zh": "本周《使命召唤：现代战争4》拿下第一，为这个老牌射击系列再添一次强势开局。国产动作游戏《影之刃零》排在第二，说明它在发售前已经吸引了大量关注。热门网游续作《AION 2》位列第三。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 925, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/95/en_b2.mp3", "duration": 75.275, "size_bytes": 452592, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 220, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/95/en_b2_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 77.275, "size_bytes": 464544, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 220, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/95/en_b2_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/95/en_b2_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 82.525, "size_bytes": 496080, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 220, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/95/en_b2_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/95/en_b2_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 70.1, "size_bytes": 421488, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 220, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/95/en_b2_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/95/en_b2_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 76.0, "size_bytes": 456912, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 220, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/95/en_b2_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@aa52671/content/data/versions/944.json", "paragraphs": ["Call of Duty: Modern Warfare 4 took first place this week, giving the long-running shooter series another strong launch. Phantom Blade Zero, the action title from a Chinese studio, came in second, which suggests it is attracting serious attention ahead of its release. AION 2, the sequel to the popular online role-playing game, finished third.", "Football Manager 27 landed in fourth place, followed by Deep Space Pawnshop: Probably Stolen in fifth. EA SPORTS FC 27, another major football title, took sixth, while the original Call of Duty claimed seventh. Final Fantasy 14, which has stayed popular for years, reached eighth.", "The bottom of the top ten was filled by two smaller titles: Moon Sweepers in ninth and Godzilla: Destroy All Monsters Melee Remastered in tenth. Valve has not said how many copies each game sold, and the list is based on revenue rather than unit sales.", "Valve has confirmed that Steam account integration will continue as planned, despite recent questions from users. Separately, the online game Gujian Online will stop receiving updates on 29 January 2026, though its servers will keep running for players who still want to log in."], "paragraphs_zh": ["本周《使命召唤：现代战争4》拿下第一，为这个老牌射击系列再添一次强势开局。国产动作游戏《影之刃零》排在第二，说明它在发售前已经吸引了大量关注。热门网游续作《AION 2》位列第三。", "《足球经理27》排在第四，第五名是《深空当铺：可能是偷的》。另一款足球大作《EA SPORTS FC 27》位居第六，初代《使命召唤》则排在第七。多年来人气不减的《最终幻想14》排在第八。", "前十名的末尾由两款较小的作品占据：《Moon Sweepers》第九，《Godzilla: Destroy All Monsters Melee Remastered》第十。Valve没有公布各游戏的具体销量，榜单依据的是收入而非份数。", "Valve确认，尽管近期用户提出疑问，Steam账户整合仍将按计划推进。另外，《古剑奇谭网络版》将于2026年1月29日停止更新，但服务器仍会继续运行，供想上线的玩家使用。"], "body": "Call of Duty: Modern Warfare 4 took first place this week, giving the long-running shooter series another strong launch. Phantom Blade Zero, the action title from a Chinese studio, came in second, which suggests it is attracting serious attention ahead of its release. AION 2, the sequel to the popular online role-playing game, finished third.\n\nFootball Manager 27 landed in fourth place, followed by Deep Space Pawnshop: Probably Stolen in fifth. EA SPORTS FC 27, another major football title, took sixth, while the original Call of Duty claimed seventh. Final Fantasy 14, which has stayed popular for years, reached eighth.\n\nThe bottom of the top ten was filled by two smaller titles: Moon Sweepers in ninth and Godzilla: Destroy All Monsters Melee Remastered in tenth. Valve has not said how many copies each game sold, and the list is based on revenue rather than unit sales.\n\nValve has confirmed that Steam account integration will continue as planned, despite recent questions from users. Separately, the online game Gujian Online will stop receiving updates on 29 January 2026, though its servers will keep running for players who still want to log in.", "body_zh": "本周《使命召唤：现代战争4》拿下第一，为这个老牌射击系列再添一次强势开局。国产动作游戏《影之刃零》排在第二，说明它在发售前已经吸引了大量关注。热门网游续作《AION 2》位列第三。\n\n《足球经理27》排在第四，第五名是《深空当铺：可能是偷的》。另一款足球大作《EA SPORTS FC 27》位居第六，初代《使命召唤》则排在第七。多年来人气不减的《最终幻想14》排在第八。\n\n前十名的末尾由两款较小的作品占据：《Moon Sweepers》第九，《Godzilla: Destroy All Monsters Melee Remastered》第十。Valve没有公布各游戏的具体销量，榜单依据的是收入而非份数。\n\nValve确认，尽管近期用户提出疑问，Steam账户整合仍将按计划推进。另外，《古剑奇谭网络版》将于2026年1月29日停止更新，但服务器仍会继续运行，供想上线的玩家使用。", "text": "Call of Duty: Modern Warfare 4 took first place this week, giving the long-running shooter series another strong launch. Phantom Blade Zero, the action title from a Chinese studio, came in second, which suggests it is attracting serious attention ahead of its release. AION 2, the sequel to the popular online role-playing game, finished third. Football Manager 27 landed in fourth place, followed by Deep Space Pawnshop: Probably Stolen in fifth. EA SPORTS FC 27, another major football title, took sixth, while the original Call of Duty claimed seventh. Final Fantasy 14, which has stayed popular for years, reached eighth. The bottom of the top ten was filled by two smaller titles: Moon Sweepers in ninth and Godzilla: Destroy All Monsters Melee Remastered in tenth. Valve has not said how many copies each game sold, and the list is based on revenue rather than unit sales. Valve has confirmed that Steam account integration will continue as planned, despite recent questions from users. Separately, the online game Gujian Online will stop receiving updates on 29 January 2026, though its servers will keep running for players who still want to log in.", "vocab": [{"word": "bestseller list", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "畅销榜", "note": "常用于游戏、图书等销售排名", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "free-to-play", "pos": "adj", "zh": "免费的（游戏）", "note": "指本体免费、靠内购盈利的游戏", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "take first place", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "夺得第一", "note": "比 win 更中性的比赛/榜单表达", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "long-running", "pos": "adj", "zh": "长期运营的", "note": "形容系列、节目等持续时间长", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "sequel", "pos": "noun", "zh": "续作", "note": "对应前作 original / predecessor", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "land in ... place", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "位列第……", "note": "榜单语境中表示排名", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "claim", "pos": "verb", "zh": "占据、拿下", "note": "claim seventh 即“排到第七”", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "remastered", "pos": "adj", "zh": "重制版的", "note": "指画面音效升级的旧作", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "revenue", "pos": "noun", "zh": "收入、营收", "note": "榜单按收入而非销量排序", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "unit sales", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "销量（份数）", "note": "与 revenue 相对", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "integration", "pos": "noun", "zh": "整合", "note": "account integration 账户整合", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "server", "pos": "noun", "zh": "服务器", "note": "游戏停更但服务器仍运行", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-12T02:23:06.579859", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "Call", "s": 0.275, "e": 0.512, "sm": 275, "em": 512, "cs": 0, "ce": 4, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "of", "s": 0.512, "e": 0.6, "sm": 512, "em": 600, "cs": 5, "ce": 7, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "Duty", "s": 0.6, "e": 1.175, "sm": 600, "em": 1174, "cs": 8, "ce": 12, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": ":", "s": 1.175, "e": 1.312, "sm": 1175, "em": 1312, "cs": 12, "ce": 13, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "Modern", "s": 1.312, "e": 1.675, "sm": 1312, "em": 1675, "cs": 14, "ce": 20, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "Warfare", "s": 1.675, "e": 2.138, "sm": 1675, "em": 2137, "cs": 21, "ce": 28, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "4", "s": 2.138, "e": 2.425, "sm": 2137, "em": 2424, "cs": 29, "ce": 30, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "took", "s": 2.425, "e": 2.625, "sm": 2425, "em": 2625, "cs": 31, "ce": 35, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": "first", "s": 2.625, "e": 2.85, "sm": 2625, "em":